--- !u!114 &1427090858
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1427090856}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5d193efaf20c8942b242a22bb2934d4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OnlyDialogueTrigger
  dialogues:
  - name: Toon
    sentences:
    - Oh great, you're finally here! I am in need of many things.
    - First, I need you to go to Crowley's planet, get me a feather from him and
      bring it back.
    - Also, there's hidden, invisible traps all over this planet. Find them all,
      mark their location on a map and bring that map to me.
    - 'The sky is much too dark around these parts. Figure out a way to change its
      shade. Perhaps a nice lemon chiffon color? '
    - Too much noise from the other planets, too. Can't hear myself think. Move them
      away.
    - Well? Get to it.
    - ...
    - 'Kidding. I don''t need anything. '
    - Except maybe some quiet... Tell Bli that when you get back to her.
  - name: Toon
    sentences:
    - You can go!
  planetNumber: 4
